          "title": "Parental Controls for AI",
          "subtitle": "Aug 2025 - Aug 2025",
          "subComponenets": [
            {
              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "I am working on a project that would allow parents to have an on going dialog with an AI application that informs how the AI should answer their children's questions.\n\nThis is inspired by my own desire to get my kids exploring with AI, but want to make sure the content being returned to them is appropriate and reflects our family's values, gives the right amount of detail around historical events, helps the right amount on school work and knows what subjects to tell my kids to come ask me about.\n\nThe project involves setting goals for the AI, context chaining and engineering, fetching nearest neighbor historical parent conversations based on document embeddings."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
